flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Initiate optimization run"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>buffer capacities X0 to X5<br/>discrete range {1-10}"]
NSGA2Alg["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>population, generations, sampling crossover mutation<br/>iterative evolution loop"]
ProblemNode["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>attributes n_var 6 n_obj 2 n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>method _evaluate evaluates a batch of individuals"]
EvalPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>parallelize evaluations across cores<br/>maps tasks to worker processes"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator**<br/>evaluate_single_individual<br/>for each individual run n replications<br/>returns objectives avg wip and negative avg throughput"]
SimCaps["**Simulation Runner With Caps**<br/>run_simulation_with_caps builds env with given caps<br/>instantiates buffers machines sinks and runs simulation"]
SimCore["**Simulation Core**<br/>run_simulation executes simpy model<br/>returns metrics throughput wip machine energy per machine"]
MachineComp["**Machine Component**<br/>attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
DelayBufferComp["**DelayBuffer Component**<br/>attributes cap delay store tokens in_transit<br/>methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
PartGenComp["**Part Generator**<br/>generates raw parts at rate one per second<br/>limits WIP at entrance"]
PopulationHistory["**Population History**<br/>stores X and F for each generation<br/>used for analysis and export"]
ParetoFront["**Pareto Front**<br/>non dominated solutions across objectives<br/>trade off WIP min and throughput max"]
Exporter["**CSV Exporter**<br/>export_history_to_csv writes generation solutions to CSV<br/>saves detailed KPI and decision variables to results folder"]
ResultsFile["**Results File**<br/>moo_simulation_results.csv in results folder<br/>contains generation index individual caps WIP throughput"]
End["**End**<br/>Optimization complete and results exported"]

Start --> DecisionVars
DecisionVars --> NSGA2Alg
NSGA2Alg --> ProblemNode
ProblemNode --> EvalPool
EvalPool --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> SimCaps
SimCaps --> SimCore
SimCore --> MachineComp
SimCore --> DelayBufferComp
SimCore --> PartGenComp
Evaluator --> ProblemNode
ProblemNode --> NSGA2Alg
NSGA2Alg --> PopulationHistory
NSGA2Alg --> ParetoFront
NSGA2Alg --> Exporter
Exporter --> ResultsFile
ResultsFile --> End